Always read **AGENTS.md** at project root for complete rules. Summary:

## Core Rules (from AGENTS.md)
1. No TODO/FIXME/HACK in code — use `tasks.md`.
2. Document after every session — append weekly summary to `docs/LEARNING_LOG.md`.
3. Tasks only in `tasks.md`.
4. Deployment allowlist: ONLY `questerix` and `questerix-student-app` may be deployed.
5. Never deploy non-allowlisted apps/surfaces (including `landing-pages` / `questerix-landing*`).
6. Admin Panel Feature Freeze — bug fixes and maintenance only; no new features.
7. Use ColumnToggle and BulkActionBar for tables.
8. Every bug fix requires a preventative test; log in LEARNING_LOG with `[test created]`.

## Known Gotchas (from GEMINI.md)
| Trap | Rule |
|------|------|
| PowerShell em-dashes | NEVER use `—` or smart quotes in `.ps1`. Use `-` only. |
| Orchestrator timeouts | Tasks delegating to scripts need ≥15 min; `900_000ms` minimum for compound tasks. |
| Supabase query builder | IMMUTABLE — chain `.eq()`, `.neq()`, `.filter()`. Never call on a stored variable without reassigning. |
| Radix Select in E2E | Use keyboard navigation (`ArrowDown` + `Enter`), not mouse clicks. |
| PowerShell -NoProfile | All automation scripts must use `-NoProfile`. |
| Draft vs Live lifecycle | Publish tests require entities to START as `draft`. Creating as `live` bypasses transition logic. |

For codebase discovery use `README.md` and `docs/architecture/PLATFORM_MAP.md`.
